  "updatedAt": "2026-10-20T03:19:21.594957Z",
  "totalBlocks": 66,
  "translatedBlocks": 65,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "15001032c2e1bbd0",
      "translationZh": "新功能：tiny-agents 现已支持 AGENTS.md 标准。🥳",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "77607bf2858d1082",
      "translationZh": "受 JS 版 Tiny Agents 的启发，我们将这一理念移植到了 Python 🐍，并扩展了 huggingface_hub 客户端 SDK，使其能够充当 MCP 客户端，从而从 MCP 服务器获取工具，并在推理期间将它们传递给 LLM。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "85ec2844b10a936c",
      "translationZh": "MCP（模型上下文协议）是一种开放协议，用于规范大型语言模型（LLM）与外部工具和 API 交互的方式。从根本上说，它消除了为每个工具编写自定义集成的需要，让你能够更轻松地为 LLM 接入新能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c66e4e7dc7dfc16",
      "translationZh": "在这篇博文中，我们将向你展示如何上手使用一个连接到 MCP 服务器的 Python 小型智能体，解锁强大的工具能力。你将看到，启动自己的智能体并开始构建是多么简单！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "624444fe656b1fa1",
      "translationZh": "提前剧透：智能体本质上就是直接构建在 MCP 客户端之上的一个 while 循环！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8a06462868e201df",
      "translationZh": "如何运行演示",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3c9b9974f286c8cf",
      "translationZh": "本节将带你了解如何使用现有的 Tiny Agents。我们将介绍相关配置，以及启动智能体所需的命令。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb193deb2f6592e1",
      "translationZh": "首先，你需要安装最新版本的 huggingface_hub，并包含 mcp 可选依赖项，以获取所有必需的组件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "37ce70521fe242b8",
      "translationZh": "现在，让我们使用 CLI 运行一个智能体！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "faf5dc5f3ae2872a",
      "translationZh": "最酷的是，你可以直接从 Hugging Face Hub 的 tiny-agents 数据集中加载智能体，也可以指定你自己的本地智能体配置路径！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "021e97b614406629",
      "translationZh": "如果你没有提供特定智能体配置的路径，我们的 Tiny Agent 默认会连接到以下两个 MCP 服务器：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a97f6e91f8386aed",
      "translationZh": "“canonical”文件系统服务器，它可以访问你的桌面；",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e6526e858948f4d4",
      "translationZh": "以及 Playwright MCP 服务器，它知道如何为你使用沙箱中的 Chromium 浏览器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "53466ec4dfe7d9fb",
      "translationZh": "下面的示例展示了一个网页浏览智能体，它被配置为通过 Nebius 推理提供商使用 Qwen/Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct 模型，并配备了一个 playwright MCP 服务器，使其能够使用网页浏览器！加载智能体配置时，需要指定它在 Hugging Face 的 tiny-agents/tiny-agents 数据集中的路径。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c5449cc3ecb6458",
      "translationZh": "运行智能体时，你会看到它加载，并列出从所连接的 MCP 服务器中发现的工具。之后，它就准备好接收你的提示词了！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b8a4d1f96159b33",
      "translationZh": "本演示使用的提示词：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "39768aafb5a8822b",
      "translationZh": "在 Brave Search 上搜索 HF 推理服务提供商，打开第一个结果，然后给我一份 Hugging Face 支持的推理服务提供商列表。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "15680fc2fe48afdb",
      "translationZh": "你还可以将 Gradio Spaces 用作 MCP 服务器！下面的示例通过 Nebius 推理服务提供商使用 Qwen/Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct 模型，并连接到一个用于图像生成的 FLUX.1 [schnell] HF Space，将其用作 MCP 服务器。该智能体根据 Hugging Face Hub 上 tiny-agents/tiny-agents 数据集中的配置加载。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b8a4d1f96159b33",
      "translationZh": "此演示使用的提示词：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64a5d5b0c0a54365",
      "translationZh": "生成一张 1024x1024 的图像，画面是一个小小的宇航员在月球表面从蛋中孵化出来。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18532d62005b60de",
      "translationZh": "现在你已经了解如何运行现有的 Tiny Agents，接下来的章节将更深入地介绍它们的工作原理，以及如何构建你自己的智能体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "840a3c05c93ab7eb",
      "translationZh": "智能体配置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aaa482af3c155b86",
      "translationZh": "每个智能体的行为（其默认模型、推理服务提供商、要连接的 MCP 服务器，以及初始系统提示词）都由一个 agent.json 文件定义。你还可以在同一目录中提供自定义的 PROMPT.md，以设置更详细的系统提示词。下面是一个示例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "53a89fd218a819fe",
      "translationZh": "agent.json 中的 model 和 provider 字段指定智能体使用的 LLM 和推理服务提供商。servers 数组定义智能体将连接的 MCP 服务器。在此示例中，配置了一个 \"stdio\" MCP 服务器。这类服务器以本地进程的形式运行。智能体使用指定的 command 和 args 启动它，然后通过 stdin/stdout 与其通信，以发现并执行可用工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b0780fff349e99d8",
      "translationZh": "你可以在这里找到有关 Hugging Face Inference Providers 的更多详细信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4dcab0e496fa5908",
      "translationZh": "大语言模型可以使用工具",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f2301e0f8eabd3a5",
      "translationZh": "现代大语言模型原生支持函数调用（或工具使用），使用户能够轻松构建针对特定用例和现实任务量身定制的应用程序。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d16e13af2a6da99",
      "translationZh": "函数由其模式定义，该模式会告知大语言模型这个函数的作用以及它预期接收哪些输入参数。大语言模型决定何时使用工具，随后由智能体编排工具的运行，并将结果反馈给大语言模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "82184fa456bcc057",
      "translationZh": "InferenceClient 实现了与 OpenAI Chat Completions API 相同的工具调用接口，该接口已成为推理服务提供商和社区公认的标准。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e5e4b47dcb4e5062",
      "translationZh": "构建我们的 Python MCP 客户端",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "415f6995042659b1",
      "translationZh": "MCPClient 是我们工具使用功能的核心。它现在已成为 huggingface_hub 的一部分，并使用 AsyncInferenceClient 与大语言模型通信。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49a8ae271c4431e0",
      "translationZh": "如果你想对照实际代码跟着看，完整的 MCPClient 代码就在这里 🤓",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "233e78520aa2085c",
      "translationZh": "MCPClient 的主要职责：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "173416be913c1b03",
      "translationZh": "管理与一个或多个 MCP 服务器的异步连接。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bf794eeff58d02ad",
      "translationZh": "发现这些服务器提供的工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "76da5e7135c9a059",
      "translationZh": "将这些工具转换为适合 LLM 使用的格式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7ff7247e1cf07346",
      "translationZh": "通过正确的 MCP 服务器执行工具调用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "039ff22704cee9ba",
      "translationZh": "下面简要展示它如何连接到 MCP 服务器（add_mcp_server 方法）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ac915a9ba837582",
      "translationZh": "它支持用于本地工具（例如访问你的文件系统）的 stdio 服务器，以及用于远程工具的 http 服务器！它还兼容 sse，这是此前用于远程工具的标准。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3b3062797478facc",
      "translationZh": "使用工具：流式传输与处理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3191aa7f007c7170",
      "translationZh": "与 LLM 的交互发生在 MCPClient 的 process_single_turn_with_tools 方法中。它通过 AsyncInferenceClient.chat.completions.create(..., stream=True) 将对话历史和可用工具发送给 LLM。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "04da56bad67b64e3",
      "translationZh": "1. 准备工具并调用 LLM",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7da40f4ed8a44c64",
      "translationZh": "首先，该方法确定当前轮次中 LLM 应当知晓的所有工具——包括来自 MCP 服务器的工具，以及用于智能体控制的任何特殊“退出循环”工具；然后，它向 LLM 发起流式调用：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f57fa6a02542ead",
      "translationZh": "随着 LLM 的响应分块陆续到达，该方法会遍历这些分块。每个分块都会立即通过 yield 产出，随后我们会重建完整的文本响应和所有工具调用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3535c354961d44eb",
      "translationZh": "2. 执行工具",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "89c9d371518ababa",
      "translationZh": "流式传输完成后，如果 LLM 请求了任何工具调用（此时已在 final_tool_calls 中完整重建），该方法就会逐一处理这些调用：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f703678b8f3ffaa9",
      "translationZh": "它首先检查所调用的工具是否会退出循环（exit_loop_tool）。如果不会，它就会找到负责该工具的正确 MCP 会话，并调用 session.call_tool()。随后，结果（或错误响应）会经过格式化、添加到对话历史中，并通过 yield 产出，以便智能体知晓工具的输出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "70b4770d76dcb33e",
      "translationZh": "我们的微型 Python 智能体：（几乎）只是一个循环！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2455942957fdc643",
      "translationZh": "有了 MCPClient 包办所有工具交互工作，我们的 Agent 类就变得极其简单。它继承自 MCPClient，并添加了对话管理逻辑。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "77b9163ba9823358",
      "translationZh": "Agent 类非常精简，专注于对话循环，代码可以在这里找到。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d66aa8b044933c68",
      "translationZh": "1. 初始化智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9bf3764d7265cf9e",
      "translationZh": "创建 Agent 时，它会接收一份智能体配置（模型、提供商、要使用哪些 MCP 服务器、系统提示词），并用系统提示词初始化对话历史。随后，load_tools() 方法会遍历服务器配置（在 agent.json 中定义），为每项配置调用 add_mcp_server（来自父类 MCPClient），从而填充智能体的工具箱。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c9dccd3effb9c6ea",
      "translationZh": "2. 智能体的核心：循环",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d97c122de4c60cd",
      "translationZh": "Agent.run() 方法是一个异步生成器，用于处理单次用户输入。它负责管理对话轮次，判断智能体当前的任务何时完成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9ba844f0011cad14",
      "translationZh": "在 run() 循环内部：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e6fb0d79b4ebffcb",
      "translationZh": "它首先将用户提示添加到对话中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "78318aceefedae21",
      "translationZh": "然后，它调用 MCPClient.process_single_turn_with_tools(...)，以获取 LLM 的响应，并处理一个推理步骤中的所有工具执行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b796432dfc9d5eed",
      "translationZh": "每一项都会被立即产出，从而能够实时流式传输给调用方。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "065044fd23875258",
      "translationZh": "每个步骤结束后，它都会检查退出条件：是否使用了特殊的“exit loop”工具、是否达到了最大轮次限制，或者 LLM 是否给出了一个看起来可以作为当前请求最终答复的文本响应。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
